Subject: [PATCH 4/6] CfgFacts: a renamed configuration, field by field
 (Cfg.mapState_eq_of_fields); the retag lemma derives from it, and CfgRecord's
 private recordStep_mapState_eq is removed for it

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../TuringMachine/Build/CfgRecord.lean        | 22 ++----------
 TCSlib/Complexity/TuringMachine/CfgFacts.lean | 35 ++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 29 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)

diff --git a/TCSlib/Complexity/TuringMachine/Build/CfgRecord.lean b/TCSlib/Complexity/TuringMachine/Build/CfgRecord.lean
